sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client<br/>(user / Gateway HTTPRoute / service)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>openshift-monitoring:prometheus-k8s
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OIDC as OIDC Issuer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (optional)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant App as Upstream App<br/>8080/TCP localhost HTTP
    participant Out as stdout<br/>(OCSF audit, optional)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Client,Out: Flow 1: Authenticated request (TokenReview + SAR)
    Client->>KRP: Any method /path<br/>Bearer token or x509 client cert
    Note over KRP: allow-paths (404) → ignore-paths bypass → timeouts
    KRP->>K8s: POST TokenReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>KRP: user / groups (cached 2 min)
    alt not authenticated
        KRP-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    loop each attribute set (Format1 rewrites / Format2 endpoint mapping)
        KRP->>K8s: POST SubjectAccessReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>KRP: allowed / denied (allow 5 min, deny 30s cache)
    end
    alt any attribute set denied, or Format2 method unmapped
        KRP-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    else all allowed
        KRP->>App: Forward request (HTTP, or HTTPS / mTLS / h2c)<br/>optional x-remote-user / x-remote-groups
        App-->>KRP: Response (upstream timeout 30s to headers)
        KRP-->>Client: Response
    end
    KRP-)Out: OCSF 1.9.0 API Activity event (when --audit-log-profile=metadata)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 225)
    Note over Prom,App: Flow 2: Prometheus metrics scrape (hardcoded authorizer)
    Prom->>KRP: GET /metrics<br/>Bearer SA token
    KRP->>K8s: POST TokenReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>KRP: system:serviceaccount:openshift-monitoring:prometheus-k8s
    Note over KRP: Hardcoded authorizer allows — no SAR issued
    KRP->>App: GET /metrics (HTTP 8080/TCP)
    App-->>KRP: metrics
    KRP-->>Prom: metrics
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over Client,App: Flow 3: OIDC-authenticated request
    KRP->>OIDC: Discovery + JWKS (startup and periodic)<br/>no auth, system or custom CA
    OIDC-->>KRP: signing keys
    Client->>KRP: Request<br/>OIDC JWT bearer (RS256 default)
    Note over KRP: JWT verified locally (no TokenReview)
    KRP->>K8s: POST SubjectAccessReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>KRP: allowed
    KRP->>App: Forward (HTTP 8080/TCP)<br/>identity headers optional
    App-->>KRP: Response
    KRP-->>Client: Response
    end
